      498.73,
      295.33,
      569.8
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 allotments in total extent of about 0.0008 Hectareof land in Preliminary Plan No. Ka:4474 and Prepared by theKalutara District Surveyor - Superintendent on behalf ofSurveyor- General situated in the Village of Kalutara North inthe No. 717 - Deshasthra of Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division ofKalutara in Kalutara District in the Western Province.",
